five case verbatims (drawn from the damaged body layer, spellings preserved and disclosed);
rule on candidate 9 (Def 22, contingent metasystem — a second Joslyn entry candidate); note
the scan's provenance finding that Def 25 (control₁) is Joslyn re-offering Turchin 1992 and
therefore grades PROP under the restatement rule — a fact the collaboration artifact should
